# Agent removes a harness directory with a pathspec read from a heredoc: git
# reads the body as paths, not as a message; only the exact message forms make
# a heredoc body data (ADR-0037, ADR-0043, ADR-0049; critic finding on
# cd258d4)
command: cargo xtask guard
expect: could modify the harness file `xtask
stdin: {"session_id": "selftest", "tool_name": "Bash", "tool_input": {"command": "git rm -r --pathspec-from-file=- <<'EOF'\nxtask\nEOF"}, "hook_event_name": "PreToolUse"}
